To add the functionality to compare the calculated pressure coefficients and lift coefficient with experimental or analytical results, we will first assume that the experimental or analytical data is provided in a separate file. We will read this file and then compare the computed values with the provided data. The comparison will be meaningful if we calculate the relative error between the computed and the provided values.

Here is the updated MATLAB code with this functionality:

